<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-RIETUMU INDEX UP 0.64 PERCENT TO 150.34.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-RIETUMU INDEX UP 0.64 PERCENT TO 150.34.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Rietumu index climbed 0.64 percent to 150.34 on Thursday, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 722 66 93</p>
